# 🔴 Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every text
# file to CRLF on the way out of git. This repo is full of source SCANS — guards
# that assert on exact markup, on declarations, and on workflow text — plus a
# node pass over the mini-app and admin JS. Normalising to LF everywhere keeps a
# Windows working copy byte-identical to what CI and the Linux runners see, so a
# test cannot pass on one machine and fail on another for an invisible reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pkl   binary
*.zip   binary
